        "original_id": "60076b48-ae9f-520a-8f7f-a01c8f93aa7b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Arrival, The Town\n- People: Denis Villeneuve, Eric Heisserer, Ted Chiang, Amy Adams, Jeremy Renner, Forest Whitaker, Dan Levine, Shawn Levy, Aaron Ryder, David Linde\n- Roles: director, writer, producer, actor, linguist\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor, Academy Award for Best Picture\n- Concepts: science fiction, extraterrestrial communication\n\nFacts:\n- Ted Chiang wrote the 1998 short story \"Story of Your Life,\" which was the basis for the film \"Arrival.\"\n- In 2010, Jeremy Renner was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for his performance in \"The Town.\"\n- \"Arrival\" is a 2016 American science fiction film directed by Denis Villeneuve and written by Eric Heisserer.\n- \"Arrival\" stars Amy Adams, Jeremy Renner, and Forest Whitaker.\n- In \"Arrival,\" Amy Adams plays linguist Louise Banks, who is enlisted by the U.S. Army to help translate communications from extraterrestrial craft that appear around the world.\n- Dan Levine was a producer of \"Arrival.\"\n- \"Arrival\" earned Dan Levine, Shawn Levy, Aaron Ryder, and David Linde an Academy Award nomination for Best Picture.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "7c7f7c3b-8d1a-5828-9afc-9506eee70733",
        "text": "Page: Arrival (film). Sentence: Arrival is a 2016 American science fiction film directed by Denis Villeneuve and written by Eric Heisserer, based on the 1998 short story \"Story of Your Life\" by Ted Chiang.\nPage: Arrival (film). Sentence: It stars Amy Adams, Jeremy Renner, and Forest Whitaker, and follows linguist Louise Banks, who is enlisted by the U.S. Army to help translate communications from one of several extraterrestrial craft that have appeared across the world.\nPage: Jeremy Renner. Sentence: He was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for his much-praised performance in \"The Town\" (2010).\nPage: Dan Levine. Sentence: Best known for producing critically acclaimed film \"Arrival\" (2016) that earned him Academy Award for Best Picture nomination with Shawn Levy, Aaron Ryder, and David Linde.",
